  "contentHtml": "<p>광섬유별자리무드등 만들기(2차시) 자료 올려요</p><p>주제선택 2시간 용입니다.</p><p>1시간 별자리 영상, 별자리 읽을거리 읽고 1차시 10분 정도 남기고 재료 나눠주고</p><p>다음 차시까지 만들면 딱 시간이 맞았어요.</p><p>별자리 구멍 뚫고 광섬유 연결해야해서 시간이 좀 걸립니다.</p><p>마무리로 기억에 남는 인상적인 별자리 써보게 하고 마무리 했어요.</p><p>2차시로 적당한 활동입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9910C1505CA4844329\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20170708_120503.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" id=\"A_9910C1505CA4844329E023\"></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99BCF5505CA484452E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20170708_120508_Burst01.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" id=\"A_99BCF5505CA484452EA857\"></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E49E505CA484472B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20170708_120513_Burst01.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" id=\"A_99E49E505CA484472BD266\"></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"vb0855rhjPrbnnEr7EybbBb\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vb0855rhjPrbnnEr7EybbBb?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZiMDg1NXJoalByYm5uRXI3RXliYkJiIiwidGlkIjoiY2JkNTRmZDItNGUyNC00OWM0LWFiYzYtNTJjNWQ1ZTYzNzljIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg5ODMxfQ.xtcP1M4XRftT1_fHe1U13twOEu6TiHtwAhRLRAvG_VI1l_WHY_dqUmdA230FU6oSP_SFMJ6stISjNnSBb0VaiQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D153%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20190403190131&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile270.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9976C8425CA484732C6ABD')\"><img sr